  "editorial": {
    "status": "working-edition",
    "notes": "Alleluia with the verse Ps 144:21. Page 35 also prints a Tract for votive Masses after Septuagesima and, for Paschaltide, an Alleluia with two verses in place of the Gradual; the feast falls between 2 and 5 January, so that form applies only to a votive Mass. Neither is modelled.",
